' ------------------------------------------------------------
' 🎨 File: style.puml (Dark Theme — Corporate Palette v7, CI-Friendly)
' ------------------------------------------------------------
' 📌 Purpose   : Unified dark theme with accessible contrasts for large projects
' 🧱 Layer     : Docs / UML Config
' 👤 Author    : Mohamed Ali
' 🗓️ Updated   : 2025-09-02
'
' 🧠 Palette (Corporate v7 — WCAG-friendly on dark):
' - Background .............. #0D1117  (Base Dark — GitHub Dark-like)
' - Foreground .............. #E6EDF3  (Near-White Text)
' - Neutral Border .......... #30363D
' - Primary (Flow/Links) .... #58A6FF  (Blue)
' - Accent (Components) ..... #A371F7  (Purple)
' - Accent (Infra/Packages) . #39C5CF  (Cyan)
' - Success (Actors) ........ #3FB950  (Green)
' - Warning (DB/Highlights) . #D29922  (Amber)
' - Danger (Errors/Notes) ... #F85149  (Red)
' ------------------------------------------------------------

